plant-rules/v1
# Centimetre-era rule file: the unit header changes the implicit default for
# every bare length below. Angles stay implicitly in radians.
unit cm
seed 777
trunk length 320
trunk radius 22
branch count 4
branch angle 0.5
branch length-ratio 0.68
branch radius-ratio 0.58
branch taper 0.5
branch bend 0.12
leaf length 24
leaf width 10
limit depth 4
limit nodes 900
material bark trunk
material bark L1
material twig twigs
attach parent 0.4
